options
========
The options directive allows configuring Pipeline-specific options from within the Pipeline itself.

What are the all different options can be used in options directive?

1) retry 
2) timeout
3) quietPeriod
4) timestamps
5) buildDiscarder
6) disableConcurrentBuilds
==
7) checkoutToSubdirectory
8) disableResume
==
9) newContainerPerStage = docker integration
==
10) overrideIndexTriggers
11) disableRestartFromStage
12) preserveStashes
==========
13) skipDefaultCheckout
14) skipStagesAfterUnstable
15) parallelsAlwaysFailFast


stage options
==============
1.skipDefaultCheckout
2.timeout
3.retry
4)timestamps